## Approach
1. Read both modules fully
2. Discover related modules (4-way split components: retro/learnings/agent-perf/skill-perf?)
3. Apply 10 audit dimensions:
   - Dead code (unused exports)
   - ADR violations (44 active ADRs)
   - Conflicting areas (duplicated logic)
   - Drift (claims vs reality)
   - Type safety
   - Dependency hygiene (.js extensions, circular deps)
   - Documentation pollution
   - Memory V2 coherence
   - Config integrity
   - Migration triage classification
4. Cite findings with file:line evidence
5. Per-file migration triage
6. Recommendations (NOT code changes)

## Constraints
- NO source code changes
- NO file deletions
- Only writes go to single audit report path
